    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d836">

                <pb facs="1018" n="1010" sameAs="frus:frus1941v04/pg1010"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.0011 European War 1939/13212: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Japan</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Grew</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Tokyo</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1941-07-17T18:00:00+09:00">July 17, 1941—6
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received July 17—9:15 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1020. For the Acting Secretary. My 1008, July 16, 2 p.m. The Vice Minister for
                    Foreign Affairs asked me to call at the Foreign Office this afternoon and said
                    that after he had conveyed to the Foreign Minister the communication orally
                    communicated by me yesterday, Mr. Matsuoka had requested him to communicate to
                    me the following reply.</p>
                <p>(See my 1021, July 17, 7 p.m., for quoted matter.<anchor n="38" xml:id="d836-f1"
                    />)</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Grew</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d836-f1" n="38" xml:id="d836-f1-content">
                <p>Telegram not printed; for quoted statement, see oral statement by the Japanese
                    Vice Minister for Foreign Affairs, <ref target="frus1931-41v02#pg_513">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>, Japan, 1931–1941, Vol. <hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">ii</hi>, p. 513</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
